node_modules/
packages/*/node_modules/
packages/cli/dist/
packages/cli/SBOM.cdx.json
release/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

.codetruss/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# The CLI acceptance fixtures. `secrets` escalates on a path matching `/\.env/`,
# so a fixture that reproduces that escalation has to be named like one — and
# `.env.*` above silently swallowed it, which would have shipped a check that
# never reached CI. Only this directory is exempt, and it holds fabricated keys.
!packages/cli/scripts/fixtures/acceptance/.env*.fixture
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
